  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You and your allies are alert for danger.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Lookout<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> For purposes of using the Lookout feat, you count as adjacent to any ally with the Lookout feat you can see. Additional, you can expend a use of mythic power to grant an ally the Lookout feat for a number of hours equal to your mythic tier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc211\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
